WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.053
Chinese AI labs could rent

00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:03.655
the Nvidia chips they were

00:00:03.455 --> 00:00:04.821
banned from buying.

00:00:04.861 --> 00:00:06.345
That gap just closed.

00:00:07.045 --> 00:00:09.631
A rule released November sixteenth

00:00:09.431 --> 00:00:11.170
says any data center,

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.248
anywhere, needs a licence to

00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:15.172
rent over about seven hundred

00:00:14.972 --> 00:00:16.788
fifty H100s of compute to

00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:19.020
companies headquartered in China.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.196
Linked sites count together.

00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:23.138
Middlemen working for a Chinese

00:00:22.938 --> 00:00:23.988
parent count too.

00:00:24.028 --> 00:00:25.810
And taking a covered customer

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.270
later still needs a licence.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.365
Advanced chip shipments to Brazil,

00:00:30.165 --> 00:00:33.517
Indonesia, Malaysia, Singapore and Thailand

00:00:33.317 --> 00:00:35.129
now need a licence too,

00:00:34.929 --> 00:00:37.402
unless the buyer is US-headquartered

00:00:37.202 --> 00:00:38.501
and files reports.

00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:42.051
Publication is expected November nineteenth.

00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:44.220
Shipments under way get thirty days.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.079
Operators already serving covered customers

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.221
get about ninety,

00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:50.102
to roughly February seventeenth.

00:00:50.652 --> 00:00:52.600
GPU sellers abroad should map

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.068
who owns each account,

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.885
check linked sites against the

00:00:55.685 --> 00:00:57.283
line, and document it.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.025
Silence from a customer is

00:00:58.825 --> 00:00:59.874
a warning sign.

00:01:00.424 --> 00:01:02.961
Chinese-owned teams on offshore clouds

00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.590
should plan for that access

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.218
to end in about three months.

00:01:06.768 --> 00:01:09.233
Chip policy used to chase boxes.

00:01:09.273 --> 00:01:10.755
Now control sits at the

00:01:10.555 --> 00:01:12.509
login, where compute is used.

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:14.432
Expect the country list to grow.

00:01:14.982 --> 00:01:16.469
The full test and every

00:01:16.269 --> 00:01:17.620
date are in the story

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.500
on The Dispatch.

